    text: "Change\r\nIncrease weekday service frequency to 3 minutes from 4.5 minutes.\r\n\nReason\r\nIncreases service along 16th Street between Union Station and Wade Blank Civic Center Station.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 42 respondents, 88% reported a positive impact from the change, 7% indicated it had no impact, and 4% perceived the change negatively."
